From 509eb96daeeaf89f58f4a92c2a78cabfffcbb16a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Gregory P. Smith" <68491+gpshead@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:30:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [3.14] gh-160314: Raise for a damaged later stream in lzma
 and bz2 (GH-160315) (#161035)

A damaged .xz or bzip2 stream that followed another stream was taken
for trailing data and silently ignored.  Leftover data that starts with
the stream magic is now treated as a stream, as gzip does.

ANT-2026-3TVAVL5A

(cherry picked from commit a4f80477b02d53a592e6d3891686921c111ae771)
Upstream: https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/509eb96daeeaf89f58f4a92c2a78cabfffcbb16a
